{"about_the_game":"Pawnbarian is a turn-based puzzle roguelike with bite-sized, but challenging sessions. Play cards to control your hero like a chess piece on a tiny dungeon board, outmaneuver enemies with their assortment of tricky abilities, and become the mightiest warrior of the Chesslands!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142080/extras/74326d232aa404f6b15b47b0f63ef264.poster.avif?t=1741025258\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142080/extras/74326d232aa404f6b15b47b0f63ef264.webm?t=1741025258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142080/extras/74326d232aa404f6b15b47b0f63ef264.mp4?t=1741025258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use a deck of chess pieces to hack and slash through hordes of monsters.<br></li><li> Pick up the basics instantly if you're familiar with chess, or learn in minutes if you aren't.<br></li><li> Carefully plan your moves to navigate challenging, emergent tactical situations.<br></li><li> Spend treasure to upgrade your cards with additional powers.<br></li><li> Blitz through quick 15-30 minute runs - or die trying.<br></li><li> Take on the infinite post-run Gauntlet to see how long you can survive.<br></li><li> Pick from 6 characters to conquer 3 dungeons, all requiring an unique approach.<br></li><li> Progress through Chains, a series of extra difficulty modifiers.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> No permanent upgrades, and not much that needs unlocking. The progress and satisfaction come from your growing mastery of the game's elegant systems!<br></li><li> No complex and varied builds. The shops provide a few key decisions, but the bulk of the roguelike depth lies in how you approach the emergent combat puzzles!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"779768ef741ec8c3822557f08d3d72a6caa14975.jpg","localized_name":"Pawnbarian","name":"Pawnbarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142080/779768ef741ec8c3822557f08d3d72a6caa14975.jpg"},{"icon":"8a47efedaff8fd058e7abb55ecc80a5296de5999.jpg","localized_name":"Pawnbarian V","name":"Pawnbarian V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142080/8a47efedaff8fd058e7abb55ecc80a5296de5999.jpg"},{"icon":"0297990e9e57ae2c33b0fb860e843c94fbac2d56.jpg","localized_name":"Pawnbarian X","name":"Pawnbarian X","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142080/0297990e9e57ae2c33b0fb860e843c94fbac2d56.jpg"},{"icon":"ff48a0534b38f2c1ea4291a971a498be6bf43c79.jpg","localized_name":"Knight Templar","name":"Knight Templar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142080/ff48a0534b38f2c1ea4291a971a498be6bf43c79.jpg"},{"icon":"e41c8651a2b30d98ad667b3ce3859bb2c111756a.jpg","localized_name":"Knight Templar V","name":"Knight Templar V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142080/e41c8651a2b30d98ad667b3ce3859bb2c111756a.jpg"},{"icon":"e5f39d791150d9c114564f15fc763331bb4a71bf.jpg","localized_name":"Knight Templar X","name":"Knight Templar X","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142080/e5f39d791150d9c114564f15fc763331bb4a71bf.jpg"},{"icon":"6c438555f54dc4d8ad81a0482df9c79edb167fad.jpg","localized_name":"Shogun","name":"Shogun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142080/6c438555f54dc4d8ad81a0482df9c79edb167fad.jpg"},{"icon":"c81889b21d470ed5ea0c4bb8a5c64b2a54955f40.jpg","localized_name":"Shogun V","name":"Shogun V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142080/c81889b21d470ed5ea0c4bb8a5c64b